            "review_text": "Kate L\nWarsaw, Poland45 contributions\n0\nNice food presentation\nDec 2023 • Family\nThis place is the best compared to those we’ve been in this area. The presentation of food is impressive and the place itself is beautiful. You can feel they pay attention to details. But there are few cons - the service could be better - they don’t bring tissues until you ask them and never approach your table after bring food, so you have to call them to ask for something.\nI recommend to try there Phu Quoc oysters.\nRead more\nWritten December 14, 2023",
